    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0479" n="165" xml:id="pg165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/668</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Guthrie</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1914-08-29T13:00:00+09:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 29, 1914, 1 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 8:30 a.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>In a conversation with Russian Ambassador yesterday he stated in most positive
                    terms that there was no agreement of any kind between Japan and Russia
                    concerning China.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guthrie</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
